 data and keep your online activity private with best-in-class VPN encryption. Secure your connection on public Wi-Fi hotspots and browse more anonymously wherever you go.\n\nBrowse with peace of mind while keeping your IP address and location private. Under our strict privacy policy, we don\u2019t collect activity logs or connection logs\u2014ExpressVPN has been independently audited to ensure your protection.\n\nGet exclusive access to Lightway, a VPN protocol developed from the ground up by ExpressVPN to offer greater speed, security, and reliability.\n\nDownload and enjoy the best VPN protection on all your devices. Available on Windows, Mac, iOS, Android, Linux, routers, smart TVs, and more.\n\nMake our VPN app work for you by switching between 19 languages.\n\nGet help in seconds, not days. Ask us anything, anytime, through 24/7 live chat support or email.\n\nTerms of Service\nhttps://www.expressvpn.com/tos\n\nPrivacy Policy\nhttps://www.expressvpn.com/privacy-policy", "short_description": "Change your IP address, enjoy a private connection with servers in 105 countries\n\nBetter than an internet proxy: Get ExpressVPN and stay private on any network, even Wi-Fi hotspots. Secure your connection with the best VPN today. Try the top-rated VPN now!\n\nDownload the best VPN on your Meta Quest devices and enjoy a 30-day money-back guarantee"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.expressvpn.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.expressvpn.com/tos", "publisher_name": "ExpressVPN", "support_website_url": "https://www.expressvpn.com/support", "website_url": "https://www.expressvpn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "R